atch: \" + parsed.igst);\nif (parsed.total_declared !== 12980) throw new Error(\"Total mismatch: \" + parsed.total_declared);\n\n\"JXA Parser Verification Passed 100%! Subtotal=\" + parsed.subtotal + \" CGST=\" + parsed.cgst + \" SGST=\" + parsed.sgst + \" IGST=\" + parsed.igst + \" Total=\" + parsed.total_declared;\n'","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolSummary":"Run JXA JavaScript parser test"}}]}
